{"ts": 1791258601.076608, "type": "step", "step": 12, "action": "files_outline", "args": {"path": "/course/readings/week3/evaluation.md"}, "output": "Evaluating agents\npass@k vs pass^k\nProxy vs direct measures", "t": 0, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.20282525443759936, "pomdp": 0.20282525443759936, "pass_k": 0.20282525443759936}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7843091835012588, "motivation": 0.8589364796632395, "reliance": 0.45602770298460465, "persistence": 0.37480768876559933, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3439719309903426, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2920196205727638, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 0.0, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791258601.679384, "type": "step", "step": 13, "action": "reader_peek_section", "args": {"path": "/course/readings/week3/evaluation.md", "section": "pass@k vs pass^k"}, "output": "# Evaluating agents\n\n## pass@k vs pass^k\npass@k: any of k runs succeeds. pass^k: all k succeed. Reliability is what deployment needs.\n\n## Proxy vs direct measures\nA quiz score is a proxy. Retention a week later is closer to the thing itself.\n", "t": 0, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.20282525443759936, "pomdp": 0.20282525443759936, "pass_k": 0.20282525443759936}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7843091835012588, "motivation": 0.8589364796632395, "reliance": 0.45602770298460465, "persistence": 0.37480768876559933, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3439719309903426, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2920196205727638, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 0.0, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
{"ts": 1791258603.3594859, "type": "step", "step": 14, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "You\u2019re stuck on the evaluation part, so here\u2019s the key idea: for this build, evaluation is about reliability, not just \u201cdid it work once.\u201d\n\nUse **pass^k** if you want to report whether the agent succeeds on **all k runs**. That\u2019s stricter than pass@k, which only asks whether **any one** of the k runs succeeds.\n\nA good way to write the eval section is:\n1. State what you measured.\n2. Say how many seeds/runs you used.\n3. Report the result as pass^k across those seeds.\n4. Briefly interpret what it means for reliability.\n\nTry drafting a 2\u20133 sentence eval paragraph using that structure. If you want, send me your draft and I\u2019ll help tighten it.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: nice, I think I see it now\n[activity] t=0 messages 2m", "t": 2, "activity": [{"t": 0, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.20282525443759936, "pomdp": 0.20282525443759936, "pass_k": 0.3275916600333845}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7843091835012588, "motivation": 0.8589364796632395, "reliance": 0.4760277029846047, "persistence": 0.37480768876559933, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3439719309903426, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2920196205727638, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.0, "seen_posts": [], "extra": {}}}
